[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7745.03, "timestamp": "02:09:05", "text": "再次。你准备好了就告诉我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7747.99, "timestamp": "02:09:07", "text": "我应该转去参军吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7749.629, "timestamp": "02:09:09", "text": "是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7752.39, "timestamp": "02:09:12", "text": "军队。我可以设置的模式。就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7765.27, "timestamp": "02:09:25", "text": "呃，你有三个，你可以从中选择一个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7766.95, "timestamp": "02:09:26", "text": "给乘员组增加一辆坦克。你有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7770.629, "timestamp": "02:09:30", "text": "就像五名船员一样。我有四架飞机。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7772.709, "timestamp": "02:09:32", "text": "猜测"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7774.229, "timestamp": "02:09:34", "text": "别管飞机的事了。我们要进去了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7782.069, "timestamp": "02:09:42", "text": "我带齐东西了吗？所以，呃，hago"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7785.99, "timestamp": "02:09:45", "text": "最上面的第一个油箱。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7788.87, "timestamp": "02:09:48", "text": "挑选一个船员来负责这项工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7795.27, "timestamp": "02:09:55", "text": "H."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7798.39, "timestamp": "02:09:58", "text": "上面写着“订购”。是的。下单。是的。"}]